STORE INFORMATION SHOWN WITH THE QUESTION:
[1] Store FAQ (Gifts and packaging). Does every watch come with a box? Yes. Veyra Atelier watches come in a wooden presentation box; other sub-brands come in a card gift box.

[2] Store FAQ (General). Can I get a watch engraved? Yes, on the caseback of steel watches. Rs. 500, ready in 2 days. Engraved watches cannot be returned.

[3] Store FAQ (Batteries and power). Do automatic watches need a battery? No. They are powered by the movement of your wrist.

