[1] Store FAQ (Buying and paying). Can I pay partly in cash and partly by card? Yes, a bill can be split between two payment methods at the counter.

[2] Store FAQ (Buying and paying). Can a gift card be used with a festive offer? Yes, a gift card is a payment method, so it can be used with any current offer.

[3] Store FAQ (General). Which payment methods are accepted? UPI, credit and debit cards, net banking, and cash. No-cost EMI is available on cards for purchases above Rs. 5,000.

